{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":19.84},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.8,"end":38.4},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.76,"end":52.8}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.56,"text":"在高度 y = h 的平面上，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.96,"end":9.44,"text":"球面方程式變成 x² + z² = r² − h²，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.08,"end":14.4,"text":"切片半徑為 √(r² − h²)。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.2,"end":16.96,"text":"根號內若為負數，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":17.28,"end":19.84,"text":"表示平面完全沒有碰到球面。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.8,"end":21.76,"text":"固定半徑 5，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.16,"end":25.2,"text":"比較高度 0、3、5，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.76,"end":29.52,"text":"觀察圓、較小的圓和極限的一個點。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":30.16,"end":32.72,"text":"再測試高度 −3。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":33.72,"end":36.16,"text":"半徑 5、高度 3 時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":36.64,"end":38.4,"text":"切片半徑是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.76,"end":42.24,"text":"半徑 5、高度 3 時，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.72,"end":44.56,"text":"切片半徑是多少？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":45.68,"end":49.68,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":50.16,"end":52.8,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}